<title>FRANCE: Havas estimates 1996 net attrib.</title>
<headline>Havas estimates 1996 net attrib.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Havas said in a statement it expected to show a net attributable profit ahead of write-downs for goodwill of just over 1.2 billion francs in 1996.</p>
<p>&quot;The net attributable profit before goodwill write-downs should be slightly higher than 1.2 billion francs compared to 1.112 billion in 1995,&quot; the statement said.</p>
<p>&quot;The net attributable after goodwill writedowns will be slightly higher than one billion francs, compared to 886 million in 1995,&quot; it said.</p>
<p>In 1996 sales were 48.5 billion francs, up 8.7 percent from 44.626 billion. Sales were up 4.7 percent at constant structure and exchange rates.</p>
